{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"RecurringPurchaseOrders\">Recurring Purchase Orders</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Pending\">Pending</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"From FromDate Is On Orders PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders RecurringPurchaseOrder RecurringPurchaseOrders Repeat Supplier Suppliers To ToDate\">Recurring purchase orders automate the creation of purchase orders on a scheduled basis, saving time for regular or repeated orders from suppliers.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"From FromDate Interval Is Item On Other Supplier To ToDate\">Use this feature when you need to order the same items from the same supplier at regular intervals, such as monthly supplies, quarterly inventory replenishments, or any other predictable ordering pattern.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Orders PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders RecurringPurchaseOrder RecurringPurchaseOrders\">Setting Up Recurring Purchase Orders</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Automatic Create Item NewRecurringPurchaseOrder On Orders Price PurchaseOrder Rate RecurringPurchaseOrder Supplier To ToDate\">To create a recurring purchase order, click the <strong>New Recurring Purchase Order</strong> button. You'll need to specify the supplier, items to order, quantities, prices, and the schedule for when orders should be automatically generated.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Create Date Manual NewPurchaseOrder On Orders PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders Rate RecurringPurchaseOrder To ToDate\">Each recurring purchase order will automatically create new purchase orders based on your defined schedule. The system will generate these orders on the specified dates without manual intervention.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Orders\">Managing Your Recurring Orders</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And By Date Delete Description Edit HasOrderBy Is IssueDate Next NextIssueDate On Orders PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders RecurringPurchaseOrder RecurringPurchaseOrders Supplier To ToDate Total\">The table below shows all your recurring purchase orders with key information including the next issue date, supplier, description, and total amount. You can edit or delete any recurring order by clicking on it.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Find HasWhere On Orders Other PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders Rate RecurringPurchaseOrder View\">When a recurring purchase order generates a new order, you'll find it in the regular <strong>Purchase Orders</strong> tab where you can review, modify if needed, and process it like any other purchase order.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Automatic Create Date Is Next Orders PurchaseOrder Rate Supplier To ToDate\">Displays the date when the next purchase order will be automatically generated. This helps you track when orders will be created and ensures you're prepared for upcoming supplier orders.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Is Name Orders PurchaseOrder Rate RecurringPurchaseOrder Supplier To ToDate\">Shows the supplier name associated with each recurring purchase order. This helps you quickly identify which supplier will receive the automatically generated orders.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Contains Description Is Notes On PurchaseOrder RecurringPurchaseOrder Reference To ToDate\">Displays the description or reference for each recurring purchase order. This typically contains details about what is being ordered or any notes to help identify the purpose of the recurring order.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Create Currency Is NewPurchaseOrder PurchaseOrder Rate RecurringPurchaseOrder Sent Supplier To ToDate Total\">Shows the total amount for each recurring purchase order in the supplier's currency. This represents the full order value that will be created each time the recurring order generates a new purchase order.</p></div></details>",
